#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "How to invite collaborators to the IBM Quantum Platform account for your organization, and manage their access"
msgstr "Cara mengundang kolaborator ke akun IBM Quantum Platform untuk organisasi kamu, dan mengelola akses mereka"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Invite users and manage their access"
msgstr "Undang pengguna dan kelola akses mereka"

#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Invite users and manage their access {#invite-users-and-manage-their-access}"
msgstr "Undang pengguna dan kelola akses mereka {#invite-users-and-manage-their-access}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Before you begin\">\n"
"Create your account's instances before you invite users. For every instance you create through IBM Quantum Platform, an associated [access group](/guides/access-groups) is automatically generated. When you invite users to an instance, you can assign them to a specific instance's access group as part of the invitation process.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Sebelum memulai\">\n"
"Buat instance akun kamu sebelum mengundang pengguna. Untuk setiap instance yang kamu buat melalui IBM Quantum Platform, sebuah [access group](/guides/access-groups) yang terkait akan dibuat secara otomatis. Saat mengundang pengguna ke sebuah instance, kamu bisa menetapkan mereka ke access group instance tertentu sebagai bagian dari proses undangan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"invite\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"invite\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Invite users to your organization's account {#invite-users-to-your-organizations-account}"
msgstr "Undang pengguna ke akun organisasi kamu {#invite-users-to-your-organizations-account}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition note=\"tip\" title=\"Users with IBM Cloud accounts\">\n"
"If a user has a previously existing IBM Cloud account, follow the instructions in the [Manage IBM Cloud users](/guides/manage-cloud-users) section.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition note=\"tip\" title=\"Pengguna dengan akun IBM Cloud\">\n"
"Jika pengguna sudah memiliki akun IBM Cloud sebelumnya, ikuti petunjuk di bagian [Kelola pengguna IBM Cloud](/guides/manage-cloud-users).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "First, ensure you have the correct account and region selected in the account and region switchers in the header.\n"
msgstr "Pertama, pastikan kamu sudah memilih akun dan region yang benar di pemilih akun dan region di header.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Select [*Access management*](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) from the main menu.\n"
msgstr "Pilih [*Access management*](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) dari menu utama.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "On the Users tab, click  \"Invite user\".\n"
msgstr "Di tab Users, klik \"Invite user\".\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Enter the users' email addresses and optionally assign the invited users to access groups.\n"
msgstr "Masukkan alamat email pengguna dan opsional tetapkan pengguna yang diundang ke access group.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The user will receive an invitation to create an IBM Cloud account and join the instance. After they accept the invitation, they will see a new account in their account switcher at the top of the IBM Quantum Platform page.\n"
msgstr "Pengguna akan menerima undangan untuk membuat akun IBM Cloud dan bergabung ke instance. Setelah mereka menerima undangan, mereka akan melihat akun baru di pemilih akun mereka di bagian atas halaman IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage a user's access groups {#manage-a-users-access-groups}"
msgstr "Kelola access group pengguna {#manage-a-users-access-groups}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To change a user's access groups, go to [*Access management*](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) from the main menu. Click the overflow menu at the end of the user's row and select *Manage access*. On the modal that opens, select the access groups the user should belong to.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengubah access group pengguna, pergi ke [*Access management*](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) dari menu utama. Klik menu overflow di akhir baris pengguna dan pilih *Manage access*. Di modal yang terbuka, pilih access group yang seharusnya dimiliki pengguna tersebut.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Remove a user {#remove-a-user}"
msgstr "Hapus pengguna {#remove-a-user}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To remove a user from an instance, go to [*Access management*](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) from the main menu. Click the overflow menu at the end of the user's row, and select *Delete*. You are prompted to confirm the deletion.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menghapus pengguna dari sebuah instance, pergi ke [*Access management*](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/users) dari menu utama. Klik menu overflow di akhir baris pengguna, dan pilih *Delete*. Kamu akan diminta untuk mengonfirmasi penghapusan.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"If a user is removed from an instance, their workloads and the associated results are no longer visible to them. Other users in the same instance can still access the workload data and results.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Jika pengguna dihapus dari sebuah instance, workload mereka dan hasil yang terkait tidak lagi terlihat oleh mereka. Pengguna lain di instance yang sama masih bisa mengakses data workload dan hasilnya.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Langkah selanjutnya {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   - Create [instances](/guides/instances#add-instance).\n"
"   - Understand the [IBM Cloud account structure](/guides/cloud-account-structure), including access policies, groups, and roles.\n"
"   - [Create and manage access groups](/guides/access-groups).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Rekomendasi\">\n"
"   - Buat [instance.](/guides/instances#add-instance)\n"
"   - Pahami [struktur akun IBM Cloud,](/guides/cloud-account-structure) termasuk kebijakan akses, grup, dan peran.\n"
"   - [Buat dan kelola access group.](/guides/access-groups)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
